            <li>Complete in Spanish or with accompanying Spanish translation</li>
            <li>Sign by hand (digital signatures not accepted at most consulates)</li>
            <li>Submit with all supporting documents at your booked consulate appointment</li>
            <li>One form per person, including dependants</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
